  "description": "Have you ever wanted a cargo bike, but never had the space for it?\nWell, have we got just the bike for you!\nIntroducing our very first cargo bike model, the Unicorn Cargo Bike. Looks like a cargo bike, rides like a normal bike- but it’s so much more than that! With the Unicorn, you get the benefit of having a bike that can carry some serious volume without needing that much space to store it. The Unicorn basically defies the laws of physics (not really).\nWith our signature quick-release mechanism on our platform, you can transform the bike from a load-bearing machine to a bike so narrow you can practically store it in your hallway. All within a span of five seconds.",
